[31mThe browser started the service worker and let it serve this document before Cypress could attach to it. The response kept its original headers and was invisible to [33mcy.intercept[39m[31m and Test Replay. If the document carries framebusting headers, the visit will time out.[39m
[31m[39m
[31mThe escaped document is Cypress's own runner, which is served on the origin under test. A service worker that origin registered in an earlier session answered for it. If you have disabled [33mtestIsolation[39m[31m, re-enable it so Cypress clears that worker before loading the runner; otherwise, clear the browser profile or this origin's site data.[39m
[31m[39m
[31mOnly the first escaped document in a spec is reported here. If this causes failures, set [33mforceHttp1[39m[31m to [33mtrue[39m[31m in your Cypress configuration to route traffic through Cypress's HTTP proxy, or configure [33mretries[39m[31m so an affected test re-runs after Cypress has attached to the worker.[39m
